  "pipeline": "SaaS",
  "email_sequences": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "subject": "Welcome to MIFECO!",
      "body": "Hi {{name}},\n\nThanks for your interest...",
      "cta": "Schedule your demo"
    }
  ]
}
```

The function handles both `emails` and `email_sequences` array key conventions.

