  1508|<h2>6. Cron Schedule</h2>
  1509|<p>The pipeline engine is driven by two cron jobs:</p>
  1510|<ul>
  1511|<li><strong>Daily Orchestrator — 8:00 AM Daily:</strong> Check AgentMail inboxes, classify leads, run enrichment, score, triage, send nurture emails, advance stages</li>
  1512|<li><strong>Weekly Backlink Scan — Sunday 8:00 AM:</strong> Scan guest post opportunities, find broken links, discover unlinked mentions, analyze competitor gaps</li>
