  1527|├── backlinks/                ← Weekly backlink scanner
  1528|├── outreach/                 ← AgentMail mailer + sequence manager
  1529|├── orchestrator/             ← Daily/weekly orchestration scripts
  1530|├── chromadb/                 ← Vector memory persistent storage
  1531|└── logs/                     ← Orchestration logs</code></pre>
